{
  "date": "2026-11-08",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "蚂蚁起诉易小满和百度：“花呗”被用作搜索广告关键词",
  "title_en": "Ant Group sues Yixiaoman and Baidu: \"Huabei\" used as a search-ad keyword",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "据北京市海淀区人民法院的公告，蚂蚁集团和蚂蚁消费金融公司（蚂蚁消金）起诉了两家公司：深圳的易小满投资咨询公司和北京的百度网讯公司。蚂蚁说，对方侵犯了商标权，还有不正当竞争的行为。",
      "en": "According to a notice from the Haidian District People's Court in Beijing, Ant Group and Ant Consumer Finance (Ant Xiaojin) have sued two companies: Yixiaoman Investment Consulting in Shenzhen and Baidu Netcom in Beijing. Ant says the other side infringed its trademark rights and engaged in unfair competition."
    },
    {
      "zh": "易小满是2023年开的公司，它的注册资本有150万元，在深圳注册。它的网页主要推广汽车抵押贷款、房产抵押贷款和信用贷款。蚂蚁认为，易小满把“花呗”和“花贝”“呗花”等相近的词设成了百度的竞价关键词。",
      "en": "Yixiaoman is a company set up in 2023, with registered capital of 1.5 million yuan, registered in Shenzhen. Its web pages mainly promote car-mortgage loans, property-mortgage loans and credit loans. Ant claims that Yixiaoman set \"Huabei\" and similar words such as \"Huabei\" with a different character and \"Beihua\" as bidding keywords on Baidu."
    },
    {
      "zh": "花呗是蚂蚁先消费、后还款的服务，用户搜索它时，可能看到贷款中介的广告。蚂蚁要求百度网讯一起承担连带责任，不再让对方使用这些词，并且在系统里拦截别人投放这些词。",
      "en": "Huabei is Ant's service that lets people spend first and repay later, and when users search for it they may see ads from loan intermediaries. Ant is asking Baidu Netcom to share liability, to stop letting the other side use these words, and to block others in its system from placing ads on these words."
    },
    {
      "zh": "另外，中国互联网金融协会10月31日发布了文件。文件规定，第三方互联网平台帮金融机构做网络宣传时，要清楚地写出金融机构的名字，不能误导用户。“花呗”和“借呗”应当只作为金融机构的产品来宣传。",
      "en": "Separately, the China Internet Finance Association issued a document on October 31. It says that when third-party internet platforms promote financial institutions online, they must state the institution's name clearly and must not mislead users. Huabei and Jiebei should be promoted only as products of financial institutions."
    }
  ],
